{"video":"tj7n9Cnbmu8","lines":[{"t":[0.8,2.6],"en":"Hey, hey, how was the first day?"},{"t":[2.8,4.1],"en":"Oh, excellent."},{"t":[4.5,6.9],"en":"Everyone was so, so nice."},{"t":[7.1,9.6],"en":"See, it pays to know the man who wears my shoes."},{"t":[10.8,11.3],"en":"Me."},{"t":[13.5,15.4],"en":"No, I didn't tell anybody that I knew you."},{"t":[15.9,16.4],"en":"Why not?"},{"t":[16.6,17.5],"en":"Well, because, you know,"},{"t":[18.2,20],"en":"they don't like you."},{"t":[24.8,25.2],"en":"What?"},{"t":[25.5,26.7],"en":"I thought you knew that."},{"t":[27.1,27.3],"en":"No."},{"t":[29.4,30.6],"en":"Who doesn't like me?"},{"t":[31.2,31.6],"en":"Everyone."},{"t":[32.9,34.7],"en":"Except for, um..."},{"t":[34.7,35.6],"en":"No, everyone."},{"t":[39,40.4],"en":"What are you talking about?"},{"t":[40.7,41.8],"en":"Don't feel bad."},{"t":[42.4,44.1],"en":"You know, they used to like you a lot."},{"t":[44.7,45.9],"en":"But then you got promoted,"},{"t":[46.1,48.2],"en":"and, you know, now you're all like Mr. Boss Man."},{"t":[48.8,49.9],"en":"You know, Mr. Bing."},{"t":[50.1,51.4],"en":"Mr. Bing, Boss Man Bing."},{"t":[54,55.4],"en":"I can't believe it."},{"t":[55.8,57.1],"en":"Yeah, yeah, they even do you."},{"t":[58.8,60.1],"en":"They do me?"},{"t":[61.2,62.8],"en":"You know, like, um, okay."},{"t":[63.3,65.5],"en":"Um, could that report B any later?"},{"t":[65.9,66.2],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[67.5,73.1],"en":"I don't sound like that."},{"t":[73.3,74.1],"en":"Oh, oh, chill."},{"t":[74.1,74.9],"en":"Yeah, you do."},{"t":[76.3,78.1],"en":"The hills are alive with the sound..."},{"t":[79.1,80.8],"en":"...of music."},{"t":[80.8,88],"en":"My scone!"},{"t":[88.4,89.5],"en":"My scone!"},{"t":[92.2,93.5],"en":"Okay, I don't sound like that."},{"t":[93.6,94.6],"en":"That is so not true."},{"t":[97.7,99],"en":"That is so not..."},{"t":[99,100.2],"en":"That is so not..."},{"t":[100.2,100.8],"en":"That..."},{"t":[100.8,101.6],"en":"Oh, shut up!"},{"t":[101.6,103.6],"en":"*laughter*"}]}
